<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia posts 668 mln rgt trade surplus in Sept.</title>
<headline>Malaysia posts 668 mln rgt trade surplus in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia had a trade surplus of 668.4 million ringgit in September against a deficit of 280 million in September 1995 and a surplus of 604.5 million ringgit in August 1996, the Statistics Department said on Saturday.</p>
<p>			 MALAYSIA TRADE BALANCE</p>
<p>			  (in billions of ringgit)</p>
<p>			    Sept 1996	  Sept 1995</p>
<p>Merchandise balance    0.668	     -0.280</p>
<p>Exports		    16.58	     16.91</p>
<p>Imports		    15.91	     17.19</p>
</text>
